 - \[Short description of non-trivial change.\]
+- Added `Session.timeout`, a default timeout used by every request sent
+  through the session (including redirects) that does not pass its own
+  `timeout`. A per-call `timeout=None` still falls back to the session
+  default; pass `timeout=(None, None)` to wait forever on a single call.
 
 
